(I)--one of the ten mind-born sons of ब्रह्मा, born of his navel; married Kardama's daughter, गती and had three sons; born from the केश of fire to which ब्रह्मा's शुक्रम् was offered; presiding over the month of माधव;
1: भा. III. १२. २२, २४; २४. २३; IV. 1. ३८; XII. ११. ३४; M. 3. 7; १७१. २७; १९५. १०; २०२. 7 and 9.
a महऋषि; his hermitage, sacred to Hari; visited by बलराम; Bharata spent his last days in it;
2: भा. VII. १४. ३०; X. ७९. १०; V. 7. 8; 8. ३०; M. १४५. ९०; वा. ५२. 2; Vi. II. १०. 5.
